WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Create a repository. Start in a new practice folder so your assignment files stay separate.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Inspect before staging. Status lists changed files. Diff shows changes that have not been staged.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Stage and review. Stage one intended file, then inspect exactly what the commit will contain.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Record the snapshot. A commit records the staged snapshot. Log shows the saved history.
